---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about">
  <div
    class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12 md:gap-20"
  >
    <div
      class="w-[280px] md:w-[320px] lg:w-[380px] mx-auto md:mx-0 shrink-0 relative group"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-white/15 to-transparent rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-700 pointer-events-none"
      >
      </div>

      <img
        src="/jairo_profile.png"
        alt="Jairo García Antolín"
        class="w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-full relative z-10 transition-transform duration-700 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-[1.04] group-hover:rotate-2"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <h2
        class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-script font-light text-gray-100 tracking-tight"
      >
        What i <span
          class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-script font-light text-gray-400 tracking-tight"
          >do</span
        >

        <div
          class="font-mono text-gray-400 md:text-[20px] text-[18px] leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-2xl mt-8"
        >
          <p>
            Software developer based in Málaga-Spain, specializing in building
            robust and scalable systems.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm currently working towards expanding my technical horizon into <span
              class="text-gray-200"
            >
              Data Engineering, Artificial Intelligence & Backend solutions.</span
            >
            <br /><br />I am passionate about creating systems that not only
            function flawlessly but also process, validate, and leverage data
            intelligently.
          </p>
        </div>
      </h2>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
